  "stem": "If \\(\\frac{a}{b} = \\frac{3}{5}\\) and \\(\\frac{b}{c} = \\frac{10}{7}\\), what is the value of \\(\\frac{a + c}{b}\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "13/10"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "\\(\\frac{a}{b} = \\frac{3}{5}\\).",
    "\\(\\frac{c}{b} = \\frac{7}{10}\\), the reciprocal of \\(\\frac{b}{c}\\).",
    "\\(\\frac{a + c}{b} = \\frac{a}{b} + \\frac{c}{b} = \\frac{6}{10} + \\frac{7}{10} = \\frac{13}{10}\\)."
  ],
  "verify": "b = symbols('b', positive=True)\na = Rational(3, 5)*b\nc = b*Rational(7, 10)\nassert simplify(b/c) == Rational(10, 7)\nans = simplify((a + c)/b)\nassert ans == Rational(13, 10)\nassert len(spr_answers) == 1 and Rational(spr_answers[0]) == ans",
